  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      392.23,
      288.97,
      513.65
    ],
    "text": "My No.: 11/3/3/1/32B Land Ministry\u2019s No.: LD/05/2010/MV/54. I, hereby give notice under sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the government intended to acquire the following land which is required for public purpose:- Description of the land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.9994001388549805,
      6.959303855895996,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      515.12,
      286.38,
      536.72
    ],
    "text": "Public purpose means the land Acquisition for the Moragahakanda & Kaluganga Development Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      538.16,
      286.46,
      663.2
    ],
    "text": "The lands described below, containing in extent 0.1723 Hectare shown in Topo PP 13 of supplement No. 98, sheet No. 249, approved by Surveyor General dated on 14.11.2018, situated at E 389 Rambukoluwa Division of Laggala Pallesiya Pattuwa, Laggala Pallegama Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Matale District, Central Province. 01. Lot No. 9578 Name of the Land: Galwangediya Kumbura; Description of the Land : Paddy field; Claimant : Private;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.16,
      539.64,
      379.28
    ],
    "text": "Possessed by: Ihala Gedara Punchi Banda of Rambukoluwa, Laggala Pallegama; Extent : 0.1723 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      381.39,
      539.63,
      441.2
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents before me at \u2026\u2026.. a.m. on the 04 day of Januray 2019 at the Laggala Divisional Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      13.918607711791992
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      443.58,
      539.61,
      528.8
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 27 day of December 2018, the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
    ]
  },
